WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:03.470
SPEAKER: Let me give you one other example.

00:00:03.470 --> 00:00:07.180
There is a brother-in-law-- this is a real case--

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:12.020
and he learns-- this is a long time ago, a couple of hundred years ago--

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:16.720
he learns that his sister's brother has died.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.650
This is down in Alabama.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:25.520
And there she is, living in not too good circumstances, in a not very nice area,

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.630
with her two children.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.360
So he's feeling kind of generous and he says, you know,

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:33.260
I have an extra house on my farm.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:37.020
If you sell the dump you're living in and move here,

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:41.160
I'll let you have this house for free, because I feel bad about you

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:43.880
living in those circumstances.

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:47.600
So she sells the house, she sells it at a loss,

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:52.030
she pulls up stakes, spends a certain amount of money moving,

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:56.610
and moves into this house that her brother-in-law has set aside

00:00:56.610 --> 00:00:59.090
for her and her children.

00:00:59.090 --> 00:01:01.570
But I told you it's a sad story.

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:07.300
After a year or so, the brother-in-law is not feeling so generous anymore,

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:11.280
and maybe he figures he doesn't like this woman all that much.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:15.040
The kids, he doesn't like having them nearby at all,

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:18.870
so he makes them move out of this house, which belongs to him,

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:22.410
and move into something much less desirable.

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:27.440
And then, after a little while later, he throws them out of that, too.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:30.740
Can the sister-in-law sue?

